        "description_Vzw6X3": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description_text": "<p>What are the elements and criteria you must consider? Unlike growing more conventional crops such as corn or soybeans, the science and know-how of truffle cultivation is by and large not available publicly. Growing European black truffles in Europe is largely straightforward, but to be successful in North America requires specific and substantial scientific know-how unavailable in the public domain.</p>"
